            "review_title": "Review at Lava Cuisine & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Nelson_Gregga\nSacramento, California15 contributions\n0\nGreat place to grab a cold beer and some fusion cuisine\nFeb 2020\nFor many years I have been coming to the 'Refinery' on Hai Ba Trung and have tried pretty much all of the restaurants that they have in this location. Boc is new to this area so I wanted to give it a try. Well, I was impressed with everything from the selection of food/drinks to the great staff. The staff made me feel right at home and I thoroughly enjoyed my beers and a small plate of food.\n\nThe location is perfect being on Hai Ba Trung - convenient if you are a tourist or a local as this is one of the main strips people use to get around the city. Interior decorating was unique with the white stucco making you feel that you are in an cave almost and the upstairs is open and airy with several spots able to look down into the Refinery courtyard for people watching. The vibe is very modern with some videos playing in a loop.\n\nBut what made the visit truly memorable was the staff. Well trained, attentive, and made me feel at home. I am sure this will become one of my new usual hangouts.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 29, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
