            "review_text": "Timmy_Read\nChelmsford, United Kingdom41 contributions\n0\nWow this place is bad, but looks good!\nNov 2019 • Couples\nSo went here as part of the HCMC Ale Trail, originally thinking that the fusion Viet/Western food would be a good meal. \nYou have to avoid the prostitutes on the way in. \nThe design of the place has been thought about, pity they didn’t bother training the teenage staff. Walking in everyone at the bar waved and said hello (in a weird way), found a seat and ordered a beer. There is something about the atmosphere that just freaks you out, but I can’t put my finger on it. \nAfter about 15mins we eventually got a Platinum beer, having to ask the manger where our beers were, there were only 6other people in the bar. We drank our very average beer very quickly and left. The food we saw did not look good. \nIf you’re doing the HCMC Ale Trail get in and out as quick as possible, but they won’t give you a nice sticker, jut a stamp that other bars can hardly see. Spend your time in the other bars on the trail, they are 1000 times better.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
